==English==
{{wikipedia|The Bronx}}

===Etymology===
Originally ''Bronck's Land'' after {{w|Jonas Bronck}} (1600–1643).

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun}}

# A [[borough]] of [[New York City]].

====Usage notes====
The term is always preceded by the [[definite article]] "the", and thus expressed as ''the Bronx''.

